{"name":"Sedona at Sunset","hex":"#bf7c45","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sunset","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The moment each evening when the sun disappears below the western horizon.","The changes in color of the sky before and after sunset."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To phase out."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sunset"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lynk (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Lynk, previously known as At Sunset were an Australian pop rock band currently consisting of brothers Harrison, Andrew and Matthew Kantarias. Past members include Jae Curtis and 2008 Australian Idol competitor Tom Jay Williams. The band currently reside in Adelaide, South Australia. They are best known as winners of the Nova FM Fresh Discovery and MTV Brand New competitions."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynk_(band)"},{"title":"Sedona, Arizona","blocks":[{"text":"Sedona is a city straddling the county line between Coconino and Yavapai counties in the northern Verde Valley region of Arizona, United States. As of the 2020 census, Sedona had a population of 9,684. The city is within the Coconino National Forest."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Cathedral_Rock_-_Sedona_AZ-1.jpg/330px-Cathedral_Rock_-_Sedona_AZ-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sedona%2C_Arizona"},{"title":"Sunset","blocks":[{"text":"Sunset is the disappearance of the Sun at the end of the Sun path, below the horizon of the Earth due to its rotation. As viewed from everywhere on Earth, it is a phenomenon that happens approximately once every 24 hours, except in areas close to the poles. The equinox Sun sets due west at the moment of both the spring and autumn equinoxes. As viewed from the Northern Hemisphere, the Sun sets to the northwest in the spring and summer, and to the southwest in the autumn and winter; these seasons are reversed for the Southern Hemisphere."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Full_cycle_of_a_Sunset_on_the_high_plains_of_the_Mojave_Desert.jpg/330px-Full_cycle_of_a_Sunset_on_the_high_plains_of_the_Mojave_Desert.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunset"},{"title":"Sunset (color)","blocks":[{"text":"The color sunset is a pale tint of orange. It is a representation of the average color of clouds when the sunlight from a sunset is reflected from them."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Sunset_2007-1.jpg/330px-Sunset_2007-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunset_(color)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Us-az-sd%29.gif/120px-Us-az-sd%29.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Us-az-sd%29.gif/250px-Us-az-sd%29.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Us-az-sd%29.gif/120px-Us-az-sd%29.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUs-az-sd).gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona%2C_AZ.jpg/500px-Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona%2C_AZ.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona%2C_AZ.jpg/1280px-Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona%2C_AZ.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona%2C_AZ.jpg/500px-Chapel_of_the_Holy_Cross%2C_Sedona